---
---
<section class="bg-cream-1 py-16 md:py-[88px]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1120px] px-6">
    <h2 class="section-h2">議事録は、<br />会議と一緒に終わってる。</h2>
    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 items-center justify-items-center gap-3 md:mt-14 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-6">
      <img class="mx-auto h-auto w-[min(100%,360px)]" src="/lp/clay-memo.webp" width="780" height="800" alt="くしゃくしゃの紙に、走り書きのメモが並んでいる" loading="lazy" />
      <svg class="-my-1 rotate-90 md:my-0 md:rotate-0" viewBox="0 0 120 90" width="112" height="84" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="ag" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0" stop-color="#7FA36B" /><stop offset="1" stop-color="#557A47" />
          </linearGradient>
          <filter id="as" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="160%">
            <feDropShadow dx="0" dy="8" stdDeviation="5" flood-color="#8C5C38" flood-opacity=".35" />
          </filter>
        </defs>
        <path d="M14 32 H64 V10 L112 45 L64 80 V58 H14 Q4 58 4 48 V42 Q4 32 14 32 Z" fill="url(#ag)" filter="url(#as)" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        <path d="M16 36 H68 V20 L100 44" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity=".45" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
      </svg>
      <div class="clay w-full rounded-clay-lg px-8 py-7">
        <p class="border-b-2 border-ink/20 pb-3.5 text-xl font-black">決まったこと</p>
        <p class="mt-[18px] text-[clamp(20px,2.4vw,26px)] leading-normal font-black">リリース日を 10/23 (金) に変更</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
